<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Saak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Saak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Saak kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Saak kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Raakiɗ ɓo' laayiɗ ɓi teeku Saak ŋ Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char>. Yeesu sah raakiɗ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> kanak teeku Saak, waaye Saak yi fiis kaɓɗohii nikee taambɗoh ŋ Yeesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeesu raakeen taambɗoh ƴaar nikiis, Saak na Suseef na Simong na Yuud.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Macce 13:55</ref></char></note> Ŋ camba, ɓa koseeɗi Yeesu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:1-5">Saaŋ 7:1-5</ref></char></note> Waaye ŋ finho hultiŋ Yeesu, ɓa kossa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:13-14">Tum ci 1:13-14</ref></char></note> Yeesu teeɓkee Saak ŋ finho hultiŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:7">1 Korenta 15:7</ref></char></note> Ŋ in gaawiɗ, Saak nikka ŋ ɓi adgoh Janguuniŋ Yerusalem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:17">Tum ci 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:13-22">15:13-22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:18">21:18</ref></char></note> Pool woyiɗ tiikiŋ ɗe ŋ kaɓɗohi a fiis ɓi Galaat.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:19">Ɓi Galaat 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:6-12">2:6-12</ref></char></note> Tiik ce namiɗ woyu ŋ fiisi Yuud kaɓɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:1">Yuud 1:1</ref></char></note> Yuud yeem namee nik taambɗoh ŋ Yeesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa miniɗ nik ne Saak fiis kaɓɗohii bala Pool fiisan kaɓɗoh ciŋ ɗe koc te ini uup ŋ kaɓɗohii wa wuu Yawuut ci kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">Saak 1:1</ref></char></note> Teerndii na woye ŋ in laayiɗ wa dokkisse nga ca waas laayiɗ : miskiɗ ci na kafind ci nik ŋ kipes kosiɗ, liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ, miskiɗ ciŋ raakiɗ ci na raakaaɗiici na etohi ɓo' etoh keeñ hooliɗ na tumohaaɗ hooliɗ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Saak kaɓɗoh kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓak naa nu nik woyuuɗ waas yino <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-11">1:2-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Miskiɗ ci na kafind ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:12-18">1:12-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Keeñ hooliɗ na tumohaaɗ hooliɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:19-26">1:19-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Miskiɗ ciŋ raakiɗ ci na raakaaɗiici <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Keeñ hooliɗ na tumohaaɗ hooliɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Raak liiɓ moɗiɗ ŋ ini yurah ŋ woo <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 3">3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Raak keeñ hoolaaɗi na ɓekke lahtoh na maɗ raak <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 4">4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kooh hey atte'e raakiɗ ci na torhiɗe ɓooɓi<char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5:1-6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh laayiɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 5:6-20">5:6-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Mi yi Saak, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Kooh na Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, mi yii fiis kaytii ne ŋ woo na ɗu, ɗu ɓi cuuɓ ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) nik ɓooɓiŋ Kooh, te ɗu pasarkohha ŋ adinaani. Ɗu moɗ jam e ?<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kos ndengiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, miskiɗ nu ɗu min degu ɗah, ambaat ne wa jam yakak nga ɗu ; <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>ɗu inah ne kosi ɗu kos hey markiskasse, na ɓi miskiɗ, te miskiɗ ceem ceɗ na ndengɗee ɗu. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Ini ndengɗeem na rimɗee ɗu, joy joy kaɗ po wa ree, nde ɗu nik ɓo' mitiɗ, ali in haawsukuu nga ɗu.<verse eid="JAS 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Te ɓo' nga ɗu tas raak liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ ɗah, a kiimaat Kooh yi na one ɓooɓi jen wa moɗoɗ te a na lahtukeeɗi nga ; a hey ɗe wa one. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Waaye a kiimohaata kosohaaɗ mitiɗ, a raakuu hel kanak ŋ Kooh, laam ɓoyi na raake hel kanak ŋ Kooh, a mand na ginaah ciŋ cookmi puuɗsi na meeɓe, faane. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Ɓo' mand ɗaa, a kinaat liiɓ ne a hey rahse in ngaŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Ɓoyeem, a ɓo' siisndiɗohiɗ, a minɗi oolku ŋ ali in ŋ in ci a na haɓɗe.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Ɓo' nu ɓaah nga ɓoo, te yaahiŋ ɗe rahsiɗɗi finhooriŋ ɗe ɗah, a neɓsaat ŋ meeɓi Kooh meeɓ ɗe. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Te ɓoyi raak, a neɓsaat ŋ ruhsiɗi Kooh ruhsiɗ ɗe. A inhaat ne a hey seeye findi pos paangi na seeyohe. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Nohi dammba ɗah, paangfi na suye suy, pos ci yaɗ, moɗ kiŋ ca coot. Wa mand ɗaa, ɓoyi raak na yaɗohe ɗaa ŋ tiindɗohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe, a coot.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Ɓoyi gen ndengɗukee ŋ miskiɗ, a neɓɗiɗ ! A hey pule nga na ndam, a rahas raayaani, weɗ kipes ki Kooh gap ɓi waaɗ ɗe.<verse eid="JAS 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe ɓek po a waaɗ tum in moɗaaɗi ɗah, a kinaat woo ne a Kooh na tumɗukohee ɗe wa. In moɗaaɗi minɗi ɓek Kooh ŋ in te Kooh ŋ haf ce na ɓekeeɗi ali ɓo' ŋ in moɗaaɗi. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Waaye yaa nu nga ɗah, a kiñin kiŋ ɗa na nookee ɗa, wa yurhiɗ ɗa ŋ ini fu waaɗ. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Waaɗ-waaɗi baahaaɗiineem weɗ na nike rook, wa ɓasil bakaaɗ ; bakaaɗeem weɗ na kaɗe po wa yak, wa eɗoh kakaan.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, kinaat ɗal ŋ inii : <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>in baahiɗ nu ɗu rahas na in mitiɗ nu ɗu eɗu ɗah, wa puloh ɗafki. Wa ruhsoh ŋ Baabi leer ci puloh nga ɗe, yi na leerɗeeɗi woti, kim a ñuusiɗ ; a na ɓoƴsukoheeɗi. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe, taambohha ŋ woo ki keeh ki, a tumiɗ ɓoo kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, ne ɓoo nik waɗiŋ ɗe koc ŋ in ci a fer jen.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sikɗuk woo kiŋ Kooh te fu pesoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, inhaat inii : Ɓo' nu nik ndengɗukaat, a sikɗuke, a gaawuu woo te a yooɓuu ayruk. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Laam, ɓo' ayrukiɗ na tumeeɗi in yurhiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Weɗ tah, wolaat in ci hoolaaɗiici nik nga ɗu jen na añaand ki laayɗi. Te na eɗef, ɗu teyɗuk woo ki ɓeku nga ɗu, weɗ min ɗu muciɗ.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Kinaat top ŋ sikɗukiŋ Woo ki dong, ineem, wa ñaañoh haf fu ; waaye pesohaata. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Ɓoyi na sikɗuke Woo ki te a pesohuu wa, a mand na ɓoyi na seetnduke ; <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>a marak haf ce ŋ seetu po ƴutta, a pulla, a jaarra alkoh findi a mand. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Waaye ɓoyi na marke ŋ waasi mit te wa faɗsee ambuuɗ ci, a ŋoɗ nga, a sikɗukuu wa ne a alkoha, waaye a pesohee wa, ɓoyeem hey barke'ɗasse ŋ in ci a na haɓɗe jen.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Ɓo' nu liiɓ ne a yi ŋ waas-Kooh, raak ɗe ambɗi nguɓiŋ ɗe ɗah, a na ñaañohe haf ce, te waas-Koohiŋ ɗe ɓarang ɓarang. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Waas-Koohi hool te wa raakɗi riiɓ ŋ fiki Kooh, yi Baabi, weɗ ne fu taambkohee yaɗuuci na ɓitiɓ ci ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan ŋ miskiɗ ciŋ ɓa, te fu namee penduk in ci hoolaaɗiiciŋ Adina.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kos talsohɗi raakiɗ na ñakiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo, kosi ɗu kos Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗ ɓoo yi raak kiyak, kinaata ambsoh na talsoh ɓo'. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Ɓo' hayeen ŋ cohiŋ ɗu, a ɓekuk kulɓa moɗiɗ na jaaru urus ; ɓo' wiiriis ñakiɗ nam hay na daah ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Ɗu eɗ cir ɓoyi na kulɓaaci moɗiɗ ci, ɗu woo ɗe ne a ɓoofaat ŋ ɗisik baahiɗ ; ɗu woo heɗ daah ci ne a tufkaat wala a ɓoof ŋ kehƴi, ŋ kot ci. <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>Ɗu tum ineem ɗah, ɗu talsoh talsoh haa e ? Teemb ndeem, ɗu nikiɗ atte'oh na liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi'iɗ !<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, sikɗukaat to. Ɗu inhiɗ baahiɗ ne a Kooh tan ñakiɗ ciŋ Adina ne ɓa nik raakiɗ ci ngaŋ kos, ɓa raak ɓak ŋ Nguuri a gap ɓi waaɗ ɗe. <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Waaye ɗu, ɗu ruhsiɗiɗ ñakiɗ ci ! Ɗu hotɗi hotɗi ne e heɗ raak-raak ci na torhiɗee ɗu, ɓa ɓayee ɗu waas ne ɗu ngela e ? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>A ɓinde na riiɓɗe tiiki moɗohngaani ɗu eɗu ? E ɓeɗ haa e ?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Fiis ci woyiɗ ne : « Waaɗa morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu. » Mbaa, ɗu taambɗoh waasiŋ Kooh, Heɗ Nguuri, ɗaa ɗah, ɗu haɓiɗ in baahiɗ. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Waaye ɗu talsohohee ɗah, wa bakaaɗ ; te waasi hey ɗu ambe findi ɓo' yurhaaɗi.<verse eid="JAS 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Ɓo' nu taambiɗ waasi, a ɗal nakoh yino dong nga ɗah, a faɗiɗa jen. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Laam Yi woo ne : « Kina njaaloo », a yi nam woo ne : « Kina ap ɓo'.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-14">Pula 20:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-18">Rohƴiɗi 5:17-18</ref></char></note> » Nik ne fu njaalooɗi na ɓitiɓ jaambur, waaye fu ap ɓo' ɗah, fu ɗaliɗ waasiŋ Kooh jen. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Ɗu inhiɗ ne ɗu hey atte'se ngaŋ waasi na faɗse ambuuɗ ci. Kon, woyohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu, na tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu hunaat naa. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Ɓo' nu yirmohɗi ɗah, a yirmassanɗi ŋ atteeni ; laam, a yirim uupiɗ atte hatil.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kos hun na tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, wa raak winde njiriñ ɓo' woyee ne a kosiɗ te kosiŋ ɗe hunɗi na tum ? Ɗu liiɓiɗ ne koseem miniɗ ɗe muciɗ e ? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Findi taambɗoh ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ, a ñak ɓekkaah, a raakuu kañam ki a etoh Kooh-nu-wiis ; <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>ɓo' nga ɗu woo ɗe ne : « Kaɗa na jam. Soosi faɗaat ɗa. Meeɗɗa haf fu ñam po fu kap. » Raak ɗa paƴiɗɗi ɗe ini a etoh ɗah, wa raak winde njiriñ ? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Kosi hunɗi na tum mand ɗaa ; wa kaaniɗ sagu niki wa nik kiik wa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Waaye, ɓo' miniɗ woo morom ce ne : Fu raak kos-kos, ŋ raakka tum-tum. Teeɓ po kosiŋ ɗa wi hunɗi na tum, ŋ teeɓ ɗa kosiŋ ngo ŋ tum-tum. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Fu kosiɗ ne Kooh yino ; ineem in baahiɗ. Waaye <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> na baahaaɗiikiŋ ca sah kosiɗa po ca na saakɗohe saakɗoh nga. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Naandɗi ! Andi fu waaɗ teeɓu ne kosi hunɗi na tum raakɗi njiriñ ?<verse eid="JAS 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Ini tah po Kooh ammba caac ɓoo Ibrahiima findi ɓo' yurhiɗ, wa ina a tumee haa e ? E dega a dege kuɓkaŋ ɗe Isaahha ne a <char style="w">seeƴkoh</char> ɗe haa e ? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Kon, fu hotiɗ ne kosiŋ ɗe hunee na tum ! E ini a tumee tah kosaŋ ɗe mit. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Ŋ ineem, ini Fiis ci woo raakka, an : « Ibrahiima kossa Kooh, tahha po Kooh ammba ɗe findi ɓo' yurhiɗ ; po a na ɓeeɗkohse nawle Kooh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Camba 15:6</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Ɗu hotiɗ nga, Kooh na ambe ɓo' findi yurhiɗ ŋ in ci a na tume, kon wa ŋ kos dong haa.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Rahab toonkoha nak, ini tah po Kooh ammba ɗe findi ɓo' yurhiɗ, wa ina a tumee haa e ? E ɗembɗa a ɗembɗee ɓooɓa Israayel ca tuuƴe, ƴutta, a lahiɗta ɓa ŋ waas wiiriis haa e ?<verse eid="JAS 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Findi faani raakɗi kiñin kaanoh, kosi hunɗi na tum kaanoh ɗaa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Peɗeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, kinaat laay ɓi nikan jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi ; ɗu inhiɗ ne, e ɓoo ɓi jangɗohoh ci raakan atteeni uupan misik. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Laam ɓoo jen, ɓoo laayiɗ findi ɓoo na kafndukohe. Ɓo' nu kafndukɗi ŋ woo ciŋ ɗe ɗah, a ɓo' mitiɗ, yi min amb cir ciŋ faaniŋ ɗe jen.<verse eid="JAS 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Ɓoo na lahɓe panis ci ne ca teyɗukiɗ ɓoo, ɓoo min ca yurhiɗ na faaniŋ ca jen ŋ ɗisik nu neɓ ɓoo. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Namaat marak <char style="tl">batooci</char>. Ini caa yake, te puuɗis yakak yeñee ca jen, wa <char style="tl">guweernaay</char> ƴissuut weɗ na tahe ɓi na nupɗee ca yurhiɗ ca ɗisik nu neɓ ɓa. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Peɗeem mand ɗaa, wa cir ƴissuut ŋ faan, waaye wa na tipaahke ngaŋ ɓi in yakak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Markaat findi melem nduuƴ ƴissuutoh, wa miniɗ hoomiɗ nduuf yakak. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Peɗeem, wa yongkaah. Fu maraka ŋ ɗooƴ cir ci ɗah, wa Adina riifiɗ na in baahaaɗi. Weɗ na kaɓe faani jen in baahaaɗi, wa doh kipes ki jen. Weɗ ŋ haf wa, wa kaɓoh ŋ yongkaaha yakka.<verse eid="JAS 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Heet ciŋ ɗoopaat ci jen, ca miniɗ koɗu, ci na tiinde, na sel ci na ci na faske ŋ kehƴi, na ciŋ cookmi, ca jen ca miniɗ koɗu te ɓo' na koɗee ca. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Waaye, ali ɓo' minɗi koɗ peɗeem ; wa njaajaani ɓo' minɗi amb, wa riifiɗ na daŋari na ape. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Weɗ ɓoo na yakɗohe Heɗ ɓoo Kooh, Baabi ; ɓoo namee wa kiimɗoh moɗaaɗi ɓooɓi Kooh fer ŋ mandohaaɗiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Moo nguɓi yino yakɗohe, yonjohe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yonj </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: kiimiɗ ɓo' Kooh in moɗaaɗi ne Kooh nikiɗa.</char></note> e ? Ineem joyɗi nikoh ɗaa, ɓaah ciŋ ngo ! <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Cul yino miniɗ pulɗe masuɓ hooliɗ na masuɓ aayiɗ e ? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ndun miniɗ rim oliiw e ? Wala reseñ miniɗ rim ndun ? Naac jemiɗ namɗi min puliɗ masuɓ neɓiɗ !<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liiɓohaaɗi moɗiɗi puloh ŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Ya ɓa raak liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ nga ɗu, a ñaannja ? A teeɓohaata na pesohaaɗ moɗiɗ ; tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe hunaat na eɗef na liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ.<verse eid="JAS 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Waaye ɓo' nga ɗu, a hot ɓo' na in, a minɗi wa raak, a raak aay-keeñ nga, wala a nik ɓoyi waaɗ ne a yi dong raakan, ɓoyeem, a kinaat yaksiɗuk nga ; a yaksiɗuk nga ɗah, a nikɗi ŋ keeh. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Liiɓohaaɗeem pulohɗi ɗafki. Wa inaa Adina, inaa ɓo', inaa <char style="w">jiini</char>. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Ɗisik nu mandohaaɗ ceem nik ɗah, wa hey raake mbalay na tumohaaɗ moɗaaɗi nu nik.<verse eid="JAS 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ liiɓohaaɗi moɗiɗi puloh ɗafki, wa hooliɗ, wa waaɗiɗ jam, wa soosiɗ, wa huniɗ na rangsuk, wa riifiɗ na yirmoh te wa na rime in baahiɗ. Wa raakɗi langɗoh, wa raakɗi naafeeha. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Waas yurhiɗ, e sokoh jam ci na sokee wa ŋ jam.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Waaɗ Adina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Wa ye ɓek lahtoh ci na hiñoh ci ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu ? E waaɗ-waaɗ ci na hiñohe ŋ ɗooƴ cir ciŋ faan ciŋ ɗu haa e ? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Ɗu na waaɗe in, ɗu raakuu wa, ɗu boomoh. Ɗu hot ɓo' na in, ɗu minuu wa raak, ɗu lahtohe, ɗu hiñohe. Ɗu na kiimeeɗi Kooh, weɗ tah ɗu raakɗi. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Ali ɗu kiim sah, ɗu rahsanɗi, laam kiimiŋ ɗu baahɗi. Ɗu na kiime ne ɗu taambiɗ waaɗ-waaɗ ciŋ ɗu.<verse eid="JAS 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Njaalo'oh ci ɗu nikoh ! Ɗu inahɗi ne ɓo' nu waaɗ Adina ɗah, a sangiɗ Kooh e ? Te ɓo' nu waaɗ nawle'koh na Adina ɗah, a sangiɗiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Ɗu liiɓiɗ ne ini Fiis ci woo, wa ɗi ŋ ɓarngi e ? Ne : « Kooh waaɗiɗ ruuhi a geniɗ nga ɓoo te a fiiriɗ nga lool. »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ini fiisu ndii ngaŋ gerek, wa raakɗi aayaani woo in mand ɗaa jok ŋ Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Koc</char>, waaye ini wa woo, ɓo' miniɗa hot ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Camba 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 6:3">6:3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:5">Pula 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:14">34:14</ref></char>. Wa namiɗ min nik ne aaya 5 na 6 joyeen toksu an : "Ɗu liiɓiɗ ne ini Fiis ci woo, wa ɗi ŋ ɓarngi e ? Inhaat ne Kooh waaɗiɗ ruuhi a geniɗ nga ɓoo te a fiiriɗ nga lool. Waaye a baah kiŋ ɗe weɗ uup. Kon ini Fiis ci woo, weɗ ne : « Kooh hunɗi na yaksiɗkoh ci, ɓi ruhsiɗ haf ɓa, ɓeɗ a na teeɓe baah kiŋ ɗe. »"</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Waaye a baah kiŋ ɗe weɗ uup. Ineem, wa hunnda na ini Fiis ci woo ne : « Kooh hunɗi na yaksiɗkoh ci, ɓi ruhsiɗ haf ɓa, ɓeɗ a na teeɓe baah kiŋ ɗe. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Gonaah ci 3:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Mbaa ñaamkaat Kooh. Ndengsiɗkohaat na Seytaani, a hey saandohe po a us ɗu. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Reɓgaat Kooh, a hey ɗu reɓge. Ɗu ɓi bakaaɗoh ci, siisndiɗohiɗ ci ɗu nikoh, ɓohñukaat te ɗu hooliɗ keeñ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Miskiɗkaat, nikaat ŋ ruy, rooyaat ! Ƴen ciŋ ɗu ɓoƴsukaat muhun, sumi ɗu sum nik tiis. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Ruhsiɗaat haf ɗu ŋ fiki Heɗi, a hey ɗu meeɓe.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo ŋ ɓo'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, kanaat ɓoofoh morom ɗu. Ɓo' nu woo in moɗaaɗi ŋ morom ce wala a attee ɗe ɗah, woo keem, a woo wa waasiŋ Kooh, te atteeneem, a attee wa waasiŋ Kooh. Ŋ ineem, a tum haf ce atte'oh waasi, te a joya joy taambiɗ. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>A yino na tufkiɗe waas a atte'e. A yi dong min mucɗoh, a yi min ɗumboh. Kon fu yi na atte'e morom fu, yaf ɓa ?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaksiɗuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Sikɗukaat ɗu ɓi na woye ne : « Woti wala kim, ɓoo hey kee kur nangam, ɓoo tum nga kiis, ɓoo toontuk, ɓoo raak kopor. » <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Ɗu inah inah kimiŋ ɗu findi wa moocohan e ? Kipes kiŋ ɗu ye ? Ɗu mand na maari na pule, wa maañuu, wa coot. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Inii kay weɗ ɗu joy woo : « Wa neɓ Heɗi ɗah, ɓoo hey pese, ɓoo haɓiɗ inii wala wii. » <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Waaye ɗu ɓii yaksiɗuk ŋ yegi ɗu yeg haf ɗu te yaksiɗuk mand ɗaa baahɗi.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Mbaa ɓoyi inah ini baahiɗi a joy haɓiɗ, a haɓiɗɗaa ɗah, a bakaaɗiɗ.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Moɗaaɗiiciŋ raak-raak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Ɗiski wa nik sikɗukaat to, ɗu ɓi heɗ raak-raak ci ! Fuɗaat ! Wililkaat sagu moɗaaɗiici rahsan ɗu ! <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Raak-raakiŋ ɗu nopiɗ ! Kulɓaaciŋ ɗu cangndiɗ ! <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Ursiŋ ɗu na haalsiŋ ɗu hoyiɗ, te hoyi ca hoy weɗ teeɓohan ɗu ! Hoyeem hey ambe faan ciŋ ɗu po wa ñam ca findi yongkaah. Ɗu ɓii nangɗoh raak-raak te ɓoo ɓeɗɗi ngaŋ reehiŋ Adina.<verse eid="JAS 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Ɗu sangiɗ wirind pangkoh ci na nguɗɗee ɗu yohon ciŋ ɗu. Sikɗukaat wirndeem ! Wa leehkiɗ, te leehuk ciŋ nguɗoh ceem reyiɗ ŋ nof ciŋ Kooh, Heɗ malaakaaci. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Ŋ kehƴi, ɗu na pesohe neɓiɗ na moɗiɗ, ɗu na yafalke yafaluk haa ɗoopti na sekɗohse mbehi a hoosohsan. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Ɗu na ambe amb ɓoyi yurah, ɗu ap ɗe, te a na ndengsiɗkoheeɗi na ɗu.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Min muñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, muñaat, ɗu sekee po Heɗi hayis. Markaat ŋ guurohi findi a na muñohe, a sekee nguɗ ci a oolkoh, ŋ toɓ ci koc po ŋ ci mirndoh. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Namaat min sek te ɗu ndengɗuk ; hayisiŋ Heɗi mand na reyiɗ.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ali ɓo' kanaat lahtuk ŋ morom ce wala ɗu hey atte'se ; atte'ohi a yi ŋ yahndeeri. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ miskiɗ ci na min muñ, markaat ŋ woosuuɗ ci woyee ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Ɓi genee ndengɗuk, ɓeɗ ɓoo amb ne ɓa neɓɗiɗ. Ɗu kerhiɗ findi Ayooɓa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ayooɓa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi farañse na woye "<char style="tl">Job</char>" ; marka ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 1">Ayooɓa</ref></char>.</char></note> genohee ndengɗuk, na ini Heɗi on ɗe ŋ mirndaani. Heɗi riifiɗ na baah na yirmoh.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini nik ŋ kiim Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, kanaat giñ muk ngaŋ Eel ci wala ngaŋ kehƴi wala ngaŋ in wiiriis nu wa min nikoh ɗah. Ɗu woo "ee" ɗah, wa nikaat "ee" te ɗu woo "a'aa" ɗah, wa nikaat "a'aa" ; ne Kooh atte'uu ɗu.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Ɓo' nga ɗu nik ŋ miskiɗ ɗah, a kiimaat Kooh. Ɓo' sum ɗah, a ƴeekaat Kooh. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Ɓo' nga ɗu kosaay ɗah, a ɓeeɗkaat yakak ci adgoh ɗu, ɓa kiimiɗ ɗe Kooh, ɓa ambsoha na reefiɗ ɗe diw ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Kiimi ɓa kiiman na kos hey ɗe mucɗe. Heɗi hey ɗe kurkiɗe. Wa raak ɗe raakiɗ bakaaɗ ɗah, Heɗi hey ɗe ɗaase. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Mbaa, woytiɗohaat bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu ŋ harmban ɗu, te yaa nu nga kiimɗee morom ce Kooh ne ɗu min wir. Kiim ɓo' yurhiɗ raakiɗ hatil lool. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/><char style="w">Ilyas</char> nikee ɓo' findi ɓoo, a kiimmba na hatil ne wa kanaat toɓ. Masuɓ keenɗi ŋ kehƴi ini ree kiis kaahay na camban. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Ƴutta a kiimissa ne wa toɓ. Wa toɓpa, kehƴi eɗohha in.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɓo' nga ɗu muuƴ, a us keeh ki ; ɓo' wiiriis dokin ɗe nga ɗah, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>inhaat ne a mucɗiɗ kiñin kiŋ ɓoyeem te bakaaɗ laayiɗ hey ulse saguuce.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
